# Admin carrier recommendation (AusPost vs Transdirect)

**Phase 1 shipped 2026-11-06.** **Phase 2 (pack presets + chargeable weight) shipped 2026-11-06.**  
Admin-only advisory — does **not** change checkout prices or auto-book carriers.

## What the owner wanted

| Customer paid | Admin “Book: …” tip |
|---|---|
| Untracked letter | **AusPost letter** (cheapest; no Transdirect equivalent) |
| Tracked parcel to metro (Syd / Mel / Bris / GC / Perth / Adelaide) | **Transdirect** (Aramex / CP often undercut Parcel Post) |
| PO Box / Parcel Locker | **AusPost only** |
| Regional / NT / TAS / remote WA | **AusPost Parcel** |
| Express / tracked letter | Stay on **AusPost** |

Helpers: `lib/shipping/shippingCarrierRecommend.ts`, `lib/shipping/auMetroPostcodes.ts`, `lib/shipping/packagingPresets.ts`.  
UI: Admin Orders list chip (`TD · Box L`) + order detail pack / chargeable lines.

## Phase 2 — four warehouse packs

| Preset id | Outer size | Typical use | Cubic @ 250 kg/m³ |
|---|---|---|---|
| `envelope-160x240` | 160×240×~12 mm | Stickers / thin letter | letter bands (not cubic-priced) |
| `envelope-240x280` | 240×280×~15 mm | Website: Market S letter singles **and 1+1 tracked** (≤20 mm) | letter / thin pack |
| `box-220x160x77` | 220×160×77 mm | **Etsy / eBay / Amazon gift box** (presentation for gift buyers) | ~**678 g** |
| `box-310x220x75` | 310×220×75 mm | DermaFix 8-pack / bulk (any channel when size needs it) | ~**1279 g** |

**Learned 2026-11-06 (owner):**  
- Website **1+1** can ship **tracked in Env 240×280** (not Box S).  
- **Box 220×160×77** is reserved for **marketplace gift packaging** (Etsy first; same for eBay/Amazon). Gift buyers expect a box.  
- **8-pack** still uses Box L even on Etsy when size requires it.

**Chargeable grams** = `max(physical, cubic)`. Couriers and AusPost own-packaging bill this way.  
An 8-pack at 280 g physical in Box L is still **~1.28 kg chargeable** → AusPost **over 1 kg up to 3 kg** band (~$20.25), not ≤500 g ($11.70).

Inference: `platformSource` etsy/ebay/amazon → Box S (unless 8-pack/≥200 g → Box L); website 1+1 / light Family Bundle → Env L; letter stickers → Env S. Optional `order.packagingPresetId` override.

Metro Transdirect tip uses **chargeable** grams (cap 2000 g). At chargeable ≥1000 g the reason warns to quote carefully vs AusPost 1 kg band.

## Market S catalogue policy ($20+ tracked)

| SKU type | Subcategory | Checkout shipping | Typical grams | Suggested pack |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Single mask sheet (low price bait) | **Single Item** | Untracked letter default; Tracked Letter ($8.10) also offered | ~30 g default | Env L / Env S |
| **1+1** as **Single Item** (≥ ~$20, not Family Bundle) | **Single Item** | Checkout **defaults to Tracked Letter $8.10**; untracked + parcel still available | ~60 g | Env L |
| **1+1** / **8-pack** as **Family Bundle** | **Family Bundle** | Parcel only (~$11.70) — no letter options | ~60 / ~280–450 g | Env L or Box L |
| **8-pack** (≥ ~$20) | **Family Bundle** | Parcel / tracked only | ~280–450 g | Box L (all channels) |
| Existing Family Bundle | Family Bundle | Parcel | default 250 g if unset | Box S or L by weight |

Do **not** register 1+1 / 8-packs as Single Item if the owner wants tracking by default.

